dssim-wasm
==========

This repository is a thin WebAssembly binding around the official
**dssim-core v3.4.0** (https://github.com/kornelski/dssim),
(c) Kornel Lesiński <pornel@pornel.net>.

dssim-core is distributed under:
- GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later (see LICENSE), or
- a commercial license available from the author
  (https://kornel.ski/dssim#licensing)

**dssim-core is used UNMODIFIED.** This repository contains no changes to
the upstream library; it adds only:

- a tiny allocation shim (`dssim_alloc`) for JS-side pixel transfer
- build/metadata glue (Cargo.toml, crate-type cdylib)
- benchmark and verification tooling (bench/)

The binding glue and the tooling in this repository are
(c) PixKeep, licensed under AGPL-3.0 (see LICENSE).

The official dssim core states that its numeric output is not directly
comparable to other tools, and that published values should cite the
implementation and version (version changes alter the scale of results).
This binding inherits that property: pin dssim-core to exactly 3.4.0 and
cite "dssim-core 3.4.0 via dssim-wasm" when publishing numbers.